  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.33300000429153 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon active dry yeast",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.33300000429153 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 tablespoons vegetable oil, divided, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine milk and sugar in a small saucepan over medium heat. Heat until slightly warm to the touch then remove from heat and stir in yeast. Let stand until foamy, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jSMQDFEWsTLC3ceSojxykThKjzk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-1-e139bfc8efc8418e9fedf1f23e705783.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together flour and salt in the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the dough hook. Add softened butter, eggs, and the yeast mixture and mix until dough pulls away from the sides of the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EjdFv3D27ExuAI9ysyXWxLNKEZc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-2-2fd3b20d8ed442db8dcc4361de64880d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a floured surface and continue to knead until the dough is smooth and elastic, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GT_ShXaXSCoAJvcswXwWJO63314=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-3-f649b698b2a6437b86f45c140b187130.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a large bowl with 1 tablespoon oil. Place the dough into the bowl and turn once to coat. Cover and let stand in a warm place until doubled in size, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vLOS5rSBQyMIl1s_zP8bnSbyKF0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-4-37b57a3122df425fa5d17ff3c9982153.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a cookie sheet or 9x13-inch pan with remaining oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "For plain rolls, punch down dough and divide into 12 equal pieces. Roll the pieces into balls and place them into the greased pan side by side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_V1YiLFdLmxDtB9Z96e4buKAMqc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-6-1fbc5408c83a4d92bc271a612a242c72.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and let dough rise again until almost doubled in size, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Jm2vtQI2bjPgIKkV05mcScW-3cQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-step-7-b4c0b57a08a641758d8660411b259d36.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27023/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until rolls are golden brown, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8u9ecuVNUxy1gCitEUnXTF4R4IM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27023-best-basic-sweet-bread-mfs-4-88a60bdae83b4388bee30ef95cb35e7e.jpg"
      ],
